category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libssl-devel perl-JSON-MaybeXS
sdesc: "Valkey client library in C (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Libvalkey is the official C client for the Valkey database. It also supports
any server that uses the RESP protocol (version 2 or 3). This project
supports both standalone and cluster modes."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/valkey-io/libvalkey
license: BSD-3-Clause
